{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS REANIMAL?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original creators of Little Nightmares\u2122 &amp; Little Nightmares\u2122 II have returned to take you on a more terrifying journey than ever before. In this co-op horror adventure game, you play as a brother &amp; sister who go through hell to rescue their missing friends. Exploring by boat and on land, you must use your wits to survive, work together to escape the hellish island, and the dark secret that haunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/9655639c19baf59912e126b071441096.poster.avif?t=1771918402\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/9655639c19baf59912e126b071441096.webm?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/9655639c19baf59912e126b071441096.mp4?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HORROR WITH HOPE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unsettling tale, the emphasis is on tension and thick atmosphere, as you join the two orphans on a desperate search for hope and redemption in the direst of circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/61e12838f2abf7149ecd25cdf06cf7bd.poster.avif?t=1771918402\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/61e12838f2abf7149ecd25cdf06cf7bd.webm?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/61e12838f2abf7149ecd25cdf06cf7bd.mp4?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACROSS A DARK AND TWISTED WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse an intriguing but terrifying world, where the main path is only one part of the fragmented story. Discover all sorts of mysterious locations on your perilous journey, each with its own story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/47847ebd48ca8fa8147e7772b019cc39.poster.avif?t=1771918402\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/47847ebd48ca8fa8147e7772b019cc39.webm?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/47847ebd48ca8fa8147e7772b019cc39.mp4?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DREAD-FILLED ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tarsier Studios is bringing their unique visual style to bear on a whole host of new twisted monsters and broken, yet resilient, child characters. Fragments of the children's troubled past have been used as inspiration for their character design, and for the monsters that now torment them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/481fa62c1fd99ed997b8667d1851c8fe.poster.avif?t=1771918402\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/481fa62c1fd99ed997b8667d1851c8fe.webm?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/481fa62c1fd99ed997b8667d1851c8fe.mp4?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHARE THE SCARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody should be forced to go through hell alone! Fully playable in single player and local &amp; online co-op, REANIMAL has a shared, directed camera, designed to maximise claustrophobia and tension.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tarred and Feathered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129530/ff238ab1ae6b72d0ca2d0a4ba3f9caac9f8a0799.jpg"},{"name":"It's a Trap!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129530/7eddab7c6c223256ce1d99b6dae9625715c69fdc.jpg"},{"name":"Happy Days","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129530/6017545a3555bb6667b824ac1157e149f5f53013.jpg"},{"name":"Scared to Dust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129530/1937ea0bed5615d07b80138b36e87f4649cfafea.jpg"},{"name":"Shot Through the Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129530/0fae540c62d93567d6eb70dd856e06617b7b822c.jpg"},{"name":"Rock 'n Pop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129530/75f23f0885cdff6239888770c76d680bc714b6b5.jpg"},{"name":"Lullabye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129530/f74a0178512cefe9fd1d6c6274f487f5af1899f1.jpg"},{"name":"Creature Comforts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129530/4f039dc5907bc828a250e77694251db9c523e566.jpg"},{"name":"Home From Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129530/a6b838eaad665cb29de383bb0e871d5c48e0ef45.jpg"},{"name":"Save Our Skins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129530/37bf6b913a6859c0e2d47264113c862c113619a4.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2129530?t=1771918402","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/f69618176f290ff25fc17798fc7d1407c582c839/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771918402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/0e28f1b3446dd979013ca3df83a3ced5d7ca611b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771918402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/0e28f1b3446dd979013ca3df83a3ced5d7ca611b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771918402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Violence or Gore, General Mature Content, Nudity and Depictions of Suicide as well as Frightening Scenes and Psychological Horror."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4019420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/fea303c942dc6dcc10680b5440dc03b4.avif?t=1771918402\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras_big/fea303c942dc6dcc10680b5440dc03b4.webp?t=1771918402 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The End is only the beginning in this mystery horror adventure! Get the Digital Deluxe Edition of REANIMAL to get the Season Pass for all three chapters of DLC, plus the exclusive Foxhead and Muttonhead masks DLC.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS REANIMAL?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original creators of Little Nightmares\u2122 &amp; Little Nightmares\u2122 II have returned to take you on a more terrifying journey than ever before. In this co-op horror adventure game, you play as a brother &amp; sister who go through hell to rescue their missing friends. Exploring by boat and on land, you must use your wits to survive, work together to escape the hellish island, and the dark secret that haunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/9655639c19baf59912e126b071441096.poster.avif?t=1771918402\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/9655639c19baf59912e126b071441096.webm?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/9655639c19baf59912e126b071441096.mp4?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HORROR WITH HOPE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unsettling tale, the emphasis is on tension and thick atmosphere, as you join the two orphans on a desperate search for hope and redemption in the direst of circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/61e12838f2abf7149ecd25cdf06cf7bd.poster.avif?t=1771918402\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/61e12838f2abf7149ecd25cdf06cf7bd.webm?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/61e12838f2abf7149ecd25cdf06cf7bd.mp4?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACROSS A DARK AND TWISTED WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse an intriguing but terrifying world, where the main path is only one part of the fragmented story. Discover all sorts of mysterious locations on your perilous journey, each with its own story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/47847ebd48ca8fa8147e7772b019cc39.poster.avif?t=1771918402\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/47847ebd48ca8fa8147e7772b019cc39.webm?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/47847ebd48ca8fa8147e7772b019cc39.mp4?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DREAD-FILLED ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tarsier Studios is bringing their unique visual style to bear on a whole host of new twisted monsters and broken, yet resilient, child characters. Fragments of the children's troubled past have been used as inspiration for their character design, and for the monsters that now torment them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/481fa62c1fd99ed997b8667d1851c8fe.poster.avif?t=1771918402\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/481fa62c1fd99ed997b8667d1851c8fe.webm?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/extras/481fa62c1fd99ed997b8667d1851c8fe.mp4?t=1771918402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHARE THE SCARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody should be forced to go through hell alone! Fully playable in single player and local &amp; online co-op, REANIMAL has a shared, directed camera, designed to maximise claustrophobia and tension.</p>","developers":["Tarsier Studios"],"dlc":[4112550,3954470],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129530/4cdda917a0155258a2e7909d7869f35d8f980f96/header.jpg?t=1771918402","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92026 TARSIER STUDIOS \u00ae AB. REANIMAL \u00ae is developed by TARSIER STUDIOS \u00ae AB and published by THQ Nordic \u00ae GmbH. THQ \u00ae and THQ Nordic \u00ae are registered trademarks of THQ Nordic \u00ae AB, Sweden. All related rights, titles, trademarks, logotypes, and copyrights used in REANIMAL \u00ae are the exclusive property of TARSIER STUDIOS \u00ae AB unless specifically stated otherwise. All rights reserved. Unreal Engine, Epic Games, Inc. Unreal, Unreal Technology, and the Powered by Unreal Technology and any respective logos are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States and elsewhere. All related other marks, trademarks, logos, and copyrights are the exclusive property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><